/* ============================================================
   THE CANON — Film Data
   Each film object:
     t        — title
     y        — year
     d        — director
     c        — country code (maps to flag via flagMap)
     s        — section name (must match exactly for grouping)
     tags     — filter tags: "silent" | "french" | "blockbuster"
     dem      — true = demanding watch (3+ hrs, slow/intense)
   Enriched fields (populated by scripts/fetch-film-data.js):
     poster   — TMDB poster URL
     trailer  — YouTube video ID
     runtime  — minutes (number)
     dop      — Director of Photography
     plot     — plot summary string
     ratings  — { imdb, rt, meta }
     language — e.g. "English"
     streaming — ["Max", "Criterion Channel"]
     why      — curated text, edit manually
   ============================================================ */

